{:edb/db-before-t 960 :edb/db-after-t 961 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534273 50 #inst "2026-10-11T18:29:17.755Z" 13194139534273 17592186045417 true] [17592186119821 1038 #edb/ref 17592186416946 13194139534273 17592186045417 true] [17592186120525 1068 #edb/ref 17592186119264 13194139534273 17592186045417 false] [17592186120525 1068 #edb/ref 17592186416945 13194139534273 17592186045417 true] [17592186120525 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534273 17592186045417 true] [17592186120525 1071 "Find the coordinates of the vector $x$ relative to the basis $B = {b_{1}, b_{2}}$, where\n$b_{1} = \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}, b_{2} = \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}, x = \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$.\nIf $[x]_{B} = \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}$ then what is the value of $x_{2}$?" 13194139534273 17592186045417 false] [17592186120525 1071 "Find the coordinates of the vector $x$ relative to the basis $B={{b}_{1},{b}_{2}},$ where\n\n$$\n{b}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{b}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]$ then what is the value of ${x}_{2}?$" 13194139534273 17592186045417 true] [17592186120525 1074 "Remember, the order of the vectors in a basis is important.\n\nNotice that \n\n$$\n{{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{x}={{(\\,2\\,)}_{⏟}}_{{x}_{1}}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{b}_{1}}+{{(\\,-4\\,)}_{⏟}}_{{x}_{2}}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{b}_{2}}\n$$\n\nwhich means that\n\n$$\nx=2\\cdot {b}_{1}+(-4)\\cdot {b}_{2}\n$$\n\nand therefore\n\n$$\n[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, we have that ${x}_{2}=-4.$" 13194139534273 17592186045417 true] [17592186416933 1043 #edb/ref 17592186416947 13194139534273 17592186045417 true] [1759218